&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Overview&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;At Microsoft AI, we are focused on accelerating the development and deployment of AI technologies that empower people and organizations to achieve more. We are on a mission to train the world&#39;s most capable AI frontier models, pushing the boundaries of scale, performance, and product deployment for Microsoft AI models. As a fast-moving, startup AI lab within Microsoft, our team operates with a strong bias for action, embracing rapid growth, continuous innovation, and operational excellence.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We&#39;re seeking a Senior Business Operations Program Manager to play a critical role in enabling the daily operations of a fast-growing organization. You will provide day-to-day technical support for internal and 3&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-fontsize=&quot;12&quot;&gt;rd&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; party tools used by the team, identify automation opportunities, and improve processes to optimize ongoing support and large-scale migration tasks.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
