&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We are the UK&#39;s leading premium publisher, home to iconic and influential media brands including Esquire, Men&#39;s &amp;amp; Women&#39;s Health, ELLE, Good Housekeeping, Harper&#39;s Bazaar, Digital Spy, Cosmopolitan, Red and more. At Hearst UK, we don&#39;t just create content – we shape culture.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Our workplace is driven by passion, shaped by authenticity and powered by creativity. We back bold ideas, act with an entrepreneurial mindset and continually evolve to meet the moment - while respecting the legacy that&#39;s brought us here. We believe in each other&#39;s potential and push boundaries together to create meaningful impact, both across the media landscape and in people&#39;s lives.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We&#39;re proud of our heritage - but even more excited about making history.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Hearst UK operates an in-office policy with flexible Fridays. Our office is based at &lt;strong&gt;House of Hearst, 30 Panton Street, St James&#39;s, London, SW1Y 4AJ&lt;/strong&gt;, where teams collaborate in person and connect across brands and functions.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Salary - £50,000 - £55,000 - Salary is dependent on experience and will be assessed in line with the candidate’s skills, knowledge, and relevant expertise.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the Fitness Director, you will lead the strategy and delivery of Women’s Health’s fitness content across all platforms, including membership, digital, print, video, social and events.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working closely with the Editor-in-chief, wider Women’s Health team, Hearst commercial team, central app leads, fitness professionals and PRs, you’ll develop compelling editorial content to the highest possible standard.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll also line manage two junior fitness writers and act as an ambassador for Women’s Health, Hearst UK and its values.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Main Duties…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead on the brand’s fitness content strategy across the website, approving daily agenda-setting ideas from two junior fitness writers, ensuring content is legally sound, in line with the brand’s stance on fitness, produced to the highest possible editorial standard, and delivered in line with deadlines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Produce multiple agenda-setting digital ideas of your own each day, optimised for SEO, Google Discover and trending news, to power womenshealthmag.com.uk’s biggest traffic vertical: fitness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Line manage two junior fitness writers, approving and feeding back on multiplatform pitches on a daily basis, and report on digital fitness performance on a weekly basis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with the brand’s social media team to lead on WH’s fitness social media strategy, while owning all fitness content in print and working with the Editor to flatplan, create and commission timely fitness features for 10 monthly issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own fitness membership content, creating two monthly members-only training plans, and lead on WH’s video fitness strategy, prioritising members-only app content to produce in-house real-time workout videos.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead on Women’s Health’s annual Fit Night Out event and additional members-only fitness events, working with events teams to plan and coordinate workouts, panels and ticket promotion, while meeting commercial sponsorship briefs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commission and edit agenda-setting freelance fitness features for both digital and print platforms, assist the editor with production of fitness bookazines and supplements, and act as an ambassador for the brand, Hearst UK, and its values, through media and public appearances.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Are Looking For…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A fitness specialist with experience leading on fitness content strategy across digital platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience producing agenda-setting digital ideas, optimised for SEO, Google Discover and trending news.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience line managing writers, approving pitches and providing feedback on multiplatform content.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience creating and commissioning high-quality fitness features for digital and print platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working across social media, video, membership content and events.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with internal teams, external fitness professionals, PRs, commercial teams and app leads.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to act as an ambassador for the brand, Hearst UK, and its values, through media and public appearances.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;(Your benefits at Hearst UK are more than just extras - they are tools to help you thrive in every part of life.)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hearst Exclusives - Only for You!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Get adventurous with Good Housekeeping Taste and Beauty Testing Panels - yes, you could be trying the next big thing in beauty, food &amp;amp; drink.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Snag luxe beauty steals at our legendary office sample sales - score big on top brands without breaking the bank!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Inclusion, Health &amp;amp; Wellbeing: Feel Your Best&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay healthy with Specsavers eye care, a company-funded Health Cash Plan, and access to mental health support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Get active and stress-free with discounted gym memberships and the Cycle to Work scheme.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Embrace flexibility with a Location Flex and Holiday Exchange to take time when you need it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take time to give back with a Charity Day and access wellbeing resources whenever you need them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Join one of our Hearst ERG Groups.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Financial Wellness - Boost Your Budget&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plan ahead with a generous Workplace Pension, Income Protection, Life Assurance and Season Ticket Loan for easier commuting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make smarter money moves using Salary Finance tools, Financial Wellbeing sessions, and Home Tech benefits to spread costs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Treat yourself with major discounts across London plus everyday savings via the HAPI at Hearst app.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hearst UK is deeply committed to using our influential brands to reflect the world we want to live in – one that respects, protects, represents and uplifts the voices and opinions of all people. As a business, we recognise the significant benefits of creativity, collaboration and innovation that comes with diverse teams. Not only is diversifying the voices in our organization the right thing to do, but it also helps us to make powerful and exciting content that can be enjoyed by many more people. This is why we’re working to build a sense of true belonging within our business and foster a culture in which everyone feels heard.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We are the UK&#39;s leading premium publisher, home to iconic and influential media brands including Esquire, Men&#39;s &amp;amp; Women&#39;s Health, ELLE, Good Housekeeping, Harper&#39;s Bazaar, Digital Spy, Cosmopolitan, Red and more. At Hearst UK, we don&#39;t just create content – we shape culture.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Our workplace is driven by passion, shaped by authenticity and powered by creativity. We back bold ideas, act with an entrepreneurial mindset and continually evolve to meet the moment - while respecting the legacy that&#39;s brought us here. We believe in each other&#39;s potential and push boundaries together to create meaningful impact, both across the media landscape and in people&#39;s lives.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;We&#39;re proud of our heritage - but even more excited about making history.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Hearst UK operates an in office policy with flexible Friday&#39;s. Our office is based at &lt;strong&gt;House of Hearst, 30 Panton Street, St James&#39;s, London, SW1Y 4AJ&lt;/strong&gt;, where teams collaborate in person and connect across brands and functions.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: white; color: black; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;border: 1pt windowtext; font-size: 10pt; padding: 0cm;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Salary - £50,000 - £60,000 - Salary is dependent on experience and will be assessed in line with the candidate’s skills, knowledge, and relevant expertise.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;As the Deputy Director of Video, you will help shape the next chapter of video at Hearst UK, developing ambitious YouTube shows and repeatable formats that build audiences across some of the UK’s most recognisable media brands.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Working closely with the Director of Video, you’ll help define and deliver the department’s slate of shows — from the first spark of an idea through development, pilots and launch. You’ll executive produce a range of shows, working closely with producers to make the work as strong as possible, while also taking direct ownership of a limited number of productions yourself.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;This is a genuinely hands-on leadership role. Alongside the creative work, you’ll help run the engine room of the video team, establishing clear and effective ways of working across budgets, planning, production and delivery. As deputy to the Director of Video, you’ll provide creative leadership, make decisions, unblock challenges and help the team deliver at pace.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;You’ll work across a portfolio of iconic Hearst brands, collaborating with senior stakeholders, producers, editors, journalists, presenters and talent to create video that audiences actively choose to watch — and come back to.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Hearst UK operates a hybrid working policy, with colleagues expected to work from the House of Hearst in London four days per week.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Main Duties…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Deputise for the Director of Video, providing creative leadership, decision-making support and day-to-day direction for the video team.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Develop and shape the department’s slate of YouTube shows, taking ideas from audience proposition and initial concept through format development, pilots and launch.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Executive produce a range of shows, working closely with producers to strengthen formats, editorial approaches and episode ideas, while reviewing scripts, briefs, production plans and edits.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Provide clear creative and editorial direction, helping producers solve challenges, make decisions and deliver high-quality work on time and to budget.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Produce a limited number of shows directly, taking ownership of format development, talent, production planning, shoot arrangements and directing filming.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Work with senior stakeholders across multiple brands, confidently presenting ideas, challenging where needed and standing behind strong editorial and creative judgement.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Own the operating rhythm of the video team, establishing clear processes for budgeting, production planning, task tracking and delivery — and making sure these are consistently followed.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Help the team prioritise competing demands across brands, identify potential issues early and keep productions moving through to delivery.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Use audience data, YouTube performance and wider insights to shape new formats and continually improve existing shows.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Build strong relationships across Hearst and develop a trusted pool of freelance producers, directors, editors, crew and other video specialists.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Are Looking For…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Significant experience in video production, with a strong track record of developing and delivering successful YouTube shows and formats.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Proven experience taking repeatable show concepts from the initial idea through development, production and launch.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Experience executive producing or overseeing other producers’ work, with the confidence to give clear, constructive creative and editorial direction.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Strong hands-on production experience, including shoot planning, working with talent and directing filming.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;A deep understanding of YouTube audiences, platform behaviour and what makes a show compelling, repeatable and capable of growing an audience.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Excellent editorial judgement, storytelling instincts and a strong eye for detail, with the ability to know when an idea, format or piece of content needs pushing further.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Confidence working with senior stakeholders across multiple brands, presenting recommendations clearly and standing behind your professional judgement.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Strong organisational and operational skills, with experience managing budgets, schedules, production trackers and delivery processes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;The ability to bring structure to a busy creative team, set clear expectations and establish practical ways of working without slowing people down.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Excellent communication and collaboration skills, with the ability to build trust across producers, editors, journalists, presenters, talent and wider teams.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;The ability to manage multiple productions and competing priorities while maintaining creative quality and keeping work moving to deadline.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;A proactive, solutions-focused approach and the ambition to help shape how Hearst UK creates video for the next generation of audiences.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; line-height: 115%;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits…&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
